    kind: work_item  # 84f9
    title: "method-call-recovery-linker still mis-binds 17 of 64 edges: the stub abstains, no receiver_type_hint is stamped, and line proximity picks the wrong class"  # 84f9
    status: todo_soft  # 84f9
    priority: 2  # 84f9
